This directory is a copy of the crate jaq-json 2.0.3 published on crates.io,
kept in the workspace of Danaco Nurt because the multiplication of a string by
a number (`"x" * n`) is implemented in the value type of the crate and cannot
be limited from outside. Changes to the upstream source:

- src/limit.rs (new): thread-local limit on the length of a repeated string.
- src/lib.rs: the multiplication of a string consults that limit; the module
  `limit` and its functions are exported.
- Cargo.toml: manifest normalized for the workspace; the crate stays publishable in metadata so that cargo-deny checks its license.
- The tests and the README of the upstream package are not included.
